WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.093
Welcome to Streaker. This mobile walkthrough uses

00:00:05.093 --> 00:00:09.072
an example panel to show you how to turn an intention

00:00:09.072 --> 00:00:10.480
into a daily record.

00:00:11.692 --> 00:00:16.832
Sign in, then tap New panel. Write your intention

00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:22.752
and choose one to five practices. Tap Draft practices

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:28.105
for AI suggestions, or enter your own. Review the

00:00:28.105 --> 00:00:30.812
draft, then tap Save panel.

00:00:32.025 --> 00:00:37.209
Each column is a practice. Tap a day once for a tick:

00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:44.185
done. Tap again for a cross: missed. Tap once more

00:00:44.185 --> 00:00:49.038
to leave it unreviewed. Pause between taps so they

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:50.105
register separately.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:55.557
To add a note, press and hold a marked cell for two

00:00:55.557 --> 00:01:00.853
seconds. Write what you want to remember, then tap

00:01:00.853 --> 00:01:05.417
Done. Hold that cell again whenever you want to edit

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:06.037
the note.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:11.356
Tap a column heading to edit it. Change the Activity

00:01:11.356 --> 00:01:16.236
name and its Value, such as ten minutes. Close the

00:01:16.236 --> 00:01:21.173
dialog when you finish. Changes to saved panels save

00:01:21.173 --> 00:01:24.716
automatically. New drafts need Save panel.

00:01:25.942 --> 00:01:30.902
Open the menu and choose Dashboard. See completed,

00:01:30.902 --> 00:01:35.402
missed, and unreviewed days, alongside your streaks

00:01:35.402 --> 00:01:40.842
and trends. Expand Notes under a practice to read

00:01:40.842 --> 00:01:42.822
the context behind your record.

00:01:44.025 --> 00:01:48.969
In the menu, open Profile and settings. Your display

00:01:48.969 --> 00:01:54.005
link shows your main panel. Use Copy link, or Open

00:01:54.005 --> 00:01:58.798
display to preview it. Choose which saved panel appears

00:01:58.798 --> 00:02:00.825
on the display from the Panels section.

00:02:02.025 --> 00:02:06.217
Open the link on a tablet, computer, or a screen

00:02:06.217 --> 00:02:11.705
that supports a web browser or image URL. It is an

00:02:11.705 --> 00:02:16.265
image, so refresh the screen to see new changes,

00:02:16.265 --> 00:02:21.193
or configure automatic refresh on your device. Anyone

00:02:21.193 --> 00:02:22.905
with the link can view it.

00:02:24.108 --> 00:02:28.124
If the image needs updating, use Update display in

00:02:28.124 --> 00:02:33.088
your profile. Then return to your ledger. Record

00:02:33.088 --> 00:02:37.852
the day, add a note when it helps, and let your practice

00:02:37.852 --> 00:02:39.388
take shape over time.
